{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いもの好きとしては嬉しいこの時期。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/18/2779724/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はむっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/18/2779724/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/18/2779724/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にこっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネームプレートをこんな贅沢に食べられる\n誕生日ってやっぱり特別〜♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ChihaFood◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして2月といえばバレンタイン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんが送ってくれた\nピエールマルコリーニの\nチョコレートも本当美味しかった(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高級なチョコレートって\n贅沢だし食べると嬉しくなれる！\n特別感がするから一粒でも十分なんだよね☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも実は勿体無くてまだ食べ終わってないけど...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/18/2779724/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレートの形も全部可愛いけど\nこのカンカンも可愛い♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カンカンとか箱とか\n取っておきたくなっちゃう系女子です..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいつも何入れよう〜？\nってなる。\nそろそろ断捨離しなきゃ(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「恋」back numberさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしがback numberさん\n好きなの知ってて\nずーがback numberさんの中で\n一番好きな曲なんだって教えてくれたの。\n\"ぼんやりと君を眺めていたんだ\n校舎の窓から やっぱりかわいいなって\"\nこの健気な感じと、\n淡い青春な感じがとても好き。\n引っ越すのかな、卒業なのかな、\n分からないけど会えなくなってしまうって\n片思いの子にとっては1番辛いよね。\n言葉を伝えられるうちに\n伝えなきゃ後悔しちゃうもんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/18/2779724/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーじょーずー♡\nまたお泊まりしに行くね( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}